# Tables

Every alignment, and a column that states none.

| Left | Center | Right | Default |
|:-----|:------:|------:|---------|
| a    | b      | c     | d       |
| *em* | `x|y`  | [l](u)| ![i](p) |

A row with too few cells is padded and one with too many is cut:

| one | two | three |
| --- | --- | ----- |
| 1   | 2   |
| 1   | 2   | 3     | 4 |

A table that is nothing but its header row:

| only | header |
| ---- | ------ |

Cells may be empty, including the first and the last:

| a | b | c |
|---|---|---|
|   | y |   |

A pipe reaches a cell as text, as code, and inside a link target:

| plain | code | link |
|-------|------|------|
| p\|q  | `x\|y` | [t](<u\|v>) |
| p\\\|q | a\\b  | [t](u)      |

Inside a block quote:

> | q | r |
> |---|---|
> | 1 | 2 |

Inside a list item:

- item

  | s | t |
  |---|---|
  | 3 | 4 |

Not a table, because the delimiter row disagrees:

| a | b |
| - |
